{%- comment -%}
  The social landing (growth engine, 16 Nov 2026). Cold visitors from Instagram, TikTok and Facebook did not
  convert on the homepage (30 days to 16 Nov: Facebook 470 sessions and 0 cart adds, Instagram 47 and 1,
  TikTok 23 and 0), so a post links here instead: one gift, one promise, one button.

  Route: any gift's page with ?view=social (templates/product.social.json), so no page is created in Shopify:
    /products/your-dogs-illustrated-mug?view=social&hook=roast&utm_source=instagram&utm_medium=social&...
  ?hook= picks the headline from this section's hook blocks by key (the first block when it is missing or
  unknown). Every utm_* and the hook ride along on the button and the other gifts' links, and
  assets/hs-attribution.js writes them to the cart's attributes, so they reach the order.

  The button opens the journey at the photo with this gift already ticked (/?gift=<gift>&step=photo, read by
  hs-journey.js init): its own tap stands in for the homepage's first button, and the gift tick is saved
  (15 taps to the painting instead of 16; docs/evidence/2026-11-16-social-landing.md). The promise is checked in the
  code: the gift page paints the buyer's dog and shows it on the gift before Add to cart, and nothing is paid
  until checkout (hs-journey-choose.js reveal; tools/preview/journey-flow.browser.test.mjs).

  Facts only from the store and canon: the product's own photo, title and prices from Shopify; free US
  shipping and the December 4 date from docs/SELLING.md, the date shown only until it passes. No reviews, no
  ratings, no counts, and no Example badge (Krish, 2 Nov).
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- render 'hs2-head' -%}
<script src="{{ 'hs-attribution.js' | asset_url }}" defer="defer"></script>
{%- liquid
  assign s = section.settings
  assign gift = 'print'
  if product.handle contains 'mug'
    assign gift = 'mug'
  elsif product.handle contains 'blanket'
    assign gift = 'blanket'
  endif
  assign gift_param = gift
  if gift == 'print'
    assign gift_param = 'portrait'
  endif
  assign hook = section.blocks | where: 'type', 'hook' | first
  assign pic = product.featured_media
  assign today = 'now' | date: '%Y-%m-%d'
  assign until = s.christmas_until | strip
  assign show_christmas = false
  if until != blank and today <= until
    assign show_christmas = true
  endif
  assign hs_mug = all_products['your-dogs-illustrated-mug']
  assign hs_blanket = all_products['your-dogs-personality-blanket']
  assign hs_portrait = all_products['your-dogs-portrait']
-%}
{%- capture price -%}
  {%- if gift == 'print' and product.price_max > product.price_min -%}
    {{ product.price_min | money_without_trailing_zeros }} unframed, {{ product.price_max | money_without_trailing_zeros }} framed
  {%- elsif product.price_max > product.price_min -%}
    from {{ product.price_min | money_without_trailing_zeros }}
  {%- else -%}
    {{ product.price_min | money_without_trailing_zeros }}
  {%- endif -%}
{%- endcapture -%}
{%- capture short_name -%}{%- case gift -%}{%- when 'mug' -%}Mug{%- when 'blanket' -%}Blanket{%- else -%}Portrait{%- endcase -%}{%- endcapture -%}
<style>
  .hsl { background: var(--hs-cream, #fbf6f1); color: var(--hs-ink, #121010); padding: 14px 16px 24px; font-family: "HS DM Sans", system-ui, sans-serif; }
  .hsl *, .hsl *::before, .hsl *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }
  .hsl__in { max-width: 520px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .hsl__eyebrow { margin: 0 0 6px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 16px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--hs-chestnut, #8a4a2b); }
  .hsl h1 { font-family: "HS Fraunces", Georgia, serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: clamp(28px, 8.4vw, 40px); line-height: 1.08; margin: 0 0 8px; text-wrap: balance; }
  .hsl h1 em { font-style: italic; color: var(--hs-stamp, #a8284e); }
  .hsl__lead { margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.4; font-weight: 600; text-wrap: pretty; }
  .hsl__line { margin: -6px 0 12px; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.45; color: var(--hs-muted, #5a4a44); text-wrap: pretty; }
  .hsl__line:empty { display: none; }
  .hsl__card { background: #fff; border: 1px solid var(--hs-line, #e2d4c8); border-radius: 20px; overflow: hidden; margin: 0 0 14px; }
  .hsl__pic { margin: 0; background: #f3ece5; }
  .hsl__pic img { display: block; width: 100%; height: clamp(180px, 34svh, 340px); object-fit: cover; object-position: center 45%; }
  .hsl__product { display: flex; align-items: baseline; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px; padding: 12px 16px; }
  .hsl__name { margin: 0; font-family: "HS Fraunces", Georgia, serif; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.25; font-weight: 600; }
  .hsl__price { margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.3; font-weight: 700; white-space: nowrap; }
  .hsl__facts { list-style: none; margin: 0 0 18px; padding: 0; display: grid; gap: 8px; }
  .hsl__facts li { display: flex; gap: 10px; align-items: flex-start; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.4; }
  .hsl__facts li[hidden] { display: none; }
  .hsl__facts svg { flex: none; margin-top: 1px; color: var(--hs-chestnut, #8a4a2b); }
  .hsl__facts b { font-weight: 700; }
  .hsl__how { margin: 0 0 18px; }
  .hsl__h2 { margin: 0 0 10px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--hs-muted, #5a4a44); }
  .hsl__steps { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 8px; counter-reset: hsl; }
  .hsl__steps li { counter-increment: hsl; }
  .hsl__steps img { display: block; width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 4 / 5; height: auto; object-fit: cover; border-radius: 12px; background: #f3ece5; }
  .hsl__steps p { margin: 6px 0 0; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.35; font-weight: 600; }
  .hsl__steps p::before { content: counter(hsl) ". "; color: var(--hs-chestnut, #8a4a2b); }
  .hsl__also { margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5; color: var(--hs-muted, #5a4a44); }
  .hsl__also a { color: var(--hs-ink, #121010); font-weight: 600; }
  .hsl__dock { position: fixed; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0; z-index: 40; padding: 10px 16px calc(12px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom)); background: linear-gradient(rgba(251, 247, 243, 0.86), rgba(251, 247, 243, 0.97) 40%); box-shadow: 0 -8px 24px -18px rgba(26, 21, 20, 0.5); text-align: center; }
  .hsl__dockline { margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: clamp(11.5px, 3.6vw, 13px); line-height: 18px; font-weight: 600; white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; }
  .hsl__btn { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 8px; max-width: 528px; height: 56px; margin: 0 auto; border-radius: 16px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; }
  body:has(.hsl__dock) { padding-bottom: calc(108px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom)); }
  .hsl :focus-visible { outline: 3px solid var(--hs-ink, #121010); outline-offset: 2px; }
  @media (max-height: 700px) and (max-width: 899px) {
    .hsl h1 { font-size: 27px; }
    .hsl__lead { font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
    .hsl__pic img { height: clamp(150px, 28svh, 220px); }
  }
  @media (min-width: 900px) {
    .hsl { padding: 40px 24px 48px; }
    .hsl__dock { position: static; background: none; box-shadow: none; padding: 4px 0 18px; }
    .hsl__btn { max-width: none; }
    body:has(.hsl__dock) { padding-bottom: 0; }
  }
</style>
<div class="hsl" data-hsl data-gift="{{ gift }}">
  <div class="hsl__in">
    <p class="hsl__eyebrow">{{ s.eyebrow | escape }}</p>
    <h1 data-hsl-h1>{{ hook.settings.headline | escape }}{% if hook.settings.headline_em != blank %} <em>{{ hook.settings.headline_em | escape }}</em>{% endif %}</h1>
    <p class="hsl__line" data-hsl-line>{{ hook.settings.line | escape }}</p>
    <script type="application/json" data-hsl-hooks>
      { {%- for b in section.blocks -%}{%- if b.type == 'hook' and b.settings.key != blank -%}{{ b.settings.key | downcase | strip | json }}: { "h": {{ b.settings.headline | json }}, "em": {{ b.settings.headline_em | json }}, "line": {{ b.settings.line | json }} }{%- unless forloop.last -%},{%- endunless -%}{%- endif -%}{%- endfor -%} }
    </script>
    <script>
      /* the hook from the post, before the first paint; an unknown key keeps the first block's words */
      (function () {
        try {
          var root = document.currentScript.closest('[data-hsl]'), q = new URLSearchParams(location.search), key = (q.get('hook') || '').toLowerCase().trim();
          var map = JSON.parse(root.querySelector('[data-hsl-hooks]').textContent || '{}'), h = key && map[key];
          if (!h || !h.h) return;
          var h1 = root.querySelector('[data-hsl-h1]'); h1.textContent = h.h;
          if (h.em) { var em = document.createElement('em'); em.textContent = h.em; h1.appendChild(document.createTextNode(' ')); h1.appendChild(em); }
          root.querySelector('[data-hsl-line]').textContent = h.line || '';
        } catch (e) { /* the first block's words stay */ }
      })();
    </script>
    <p class="hsl__lead">{{ s.lead | escape }}</p>
    <div class="hsl__card">
      {%- if pic -%}
        <figure class="hsl__pic">
          <img src="{{ pic | image_url: width: 900 }}" srcset="{{ pic | image_url: width: 600 }} 600w, {{ pic | image_url: width: 900 }} 900w, {{ pic | image_url: width: 1200 }} 1200w" sizes="(min-width: 900px) 520px, 100vw" alt="{{ pic.alt | default: product.title | escape }}" width="1200" height="1200" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async">
        </figure>
      {%- endif -%}
      <div class="hsl__product">
        <p class="hsl__name">{{ product.title | escape }}</p>
        <p class="hsl__price">{{ price | strip }}</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <ul class="hsl__facts">
      <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M3.5 7.5h11v8h-11zM14.5 10.5h3.5l2.5 3v2h-6"/><circle cx="7" cy="17" r="1.6"/><circle cx="17" cy="17" r="1.6"/></svg><span><b>{{ s.shipping | escape }}</b>{% if show_christmas %} {{ s.christmas_line | escape }}{% endif %}</span></li>
      <li data-hsl-bundle hidden><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M4 11.5 12.5 3H20v7.5L11.5 19z"/><circle cx="16" cy="7" r="1.3"/></svg><span>{{ s.bundle_line | escape }}</span></li>
      <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M4 6.5h16v11H4z"/><path d="m4 7 8 6 8-6"/></svg><span>{{ s.note_line | escape }}</span></li>
      <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="m5 12.5 4.5 4.5L19 7.5"/></svg><span>{{ s.check_line | escape }}</span></li>
    </ul>
    <div class="hsl__how">
      <h2 class="hsl__h2">{{ s.how_heading | escape }}</h2>
      <ol class="hsl__steps">
        <li><img src="{{ 'hs-ex-flow-photo.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="Reference photo: a golden retriever sitting on a tiled floor." width="720" height="900" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><p>{{ s.step_1 | escape }}</p></li>
        <li><img src="{{ 'hs-ex-flow-painting.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="Example painting of the same golden retriever in a play bow on a fleece blanket with a plush toy." width="720" height="900" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><p>{{ s.step_2 | escape }}</p></li>
        <li><img src="{{ 'hs-ex-flow-gift.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="Example: the painting on a black-handled mug held in a hand." width="720" height="900" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><p>{{ s.step_3 | escape }}</p></li>
      </ol>
    </div>
    {%- capture also -%}
      {%- if gift != 'mug' and hs_mug.id -%}<a href="{{ hs_mug.url }}?view=social" data-hsl-carry>the mug, {{ hs_mug.price_min | money_without_trailing_zeros }}</a>|{%- endif -%}
      {%- if gift != 'blanket' and hs_blanket.id -%}<a href="{{ hs_blanket.url }}?view=social" data-hsl-carry>the blanket, {{ hs_blanket.price_min | money_without_trailing_zeros }}</a>|{%- endif -%}
      {%- if gift != 'print' and hs_portrait.id -%}<a href="{{ hs_portrait.url }}?view=social" data-hsl-carry>the portrait, from {{ hs_portrait.price_min | money_without_trailing_zeros }}</a>|{%- endif -%}
    {%- endcapture -%}
    {%- assign also_list = also | strip | split: '|' -%}
    {%- if also_list.size > 0 -%}<p class="hsl__also">{{ s.also_label | escape }} {{ also_list | join: ', ' }}.</p>{%- endif -%}
    <div class="hsl__dock">
      <p class="hsl__dockline">{{ short_name }} {{ price | strip }} · {{ s.dock_line | escape }}</p>
      <a class="hsl__btn hs-btn-heart" href="{{ routes.root_url }}?gift={{ gift_param }}&amp;step=photo" data-hsl-go data-hsl-carry>{{ s.cta | escape }}<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h13M13 6.5 18.5 12 13 17.5"/></svg></a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <script>
    /* the post's utm_* and hook ride along on every link out of this page; the bundle line shows only while the
       memo strip says the automatic discount exists (as hs-journey.js offerText does) */
    (function (root) {
      try {
        var q = new URLSearchParams(location.search), keep = [];
        q.forEach(function (v, k) { if (/^utm_(source|medium|campaign|content|term)$/.test(k) || k === 'hook') keep.push([k, v]); });
        root.querySelectorAll('[data-hsl-carry]').forEach(function (a) {
          var u = new URL(a.getAttribute('href'), location.href);
          keep.forEach(function (p) { if (!u.searchParams.has(p[0])) u.searchParams.set(p[0], p[1]); });
          a.setAttribute('href', u.pathname + u.search);
        });
        if (document.querySelector('[data-hs-bundle-live]')) root.querySelector('[data-hsl-bundle]').hidden = false;
      } catch (e) { /* the plain links still work */ }
    })(document.currentScript.closest('[data-hsl]'));
  </script>
</div>
{% schema %}
{
  "name": "HS social landing",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "paragraph", "content": "The landing for social posts: any gift's page with ?view=social. ?hook= picks a headline below by its key. The product, photo and prices come from Shopify." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "eyebrow", "label": "Eyebrow", "default": "Gifts from your dog" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "lead", "label": "The promise", "default": "See your dog painted, free, before you buy." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "shipping", "label": "Shipping", "default": "Free US shipping." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "christmas_line", "label": "Christmas date", "default": "Order by December 4 for Christmas delivery to a US address." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "christmas_until", "label": "Show the Christmas date until", "info": "YYYY-MM-DD, the last order date docs/SELLING.md confirms. Empty hides it.", "default": "2026-12-04" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "bundle_line", "label": "Bundle saving", "info": "Shows only while the memo strip's bundle switch is on.", "default": "Two gifts: 15% off. All 3: 20% off." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "note_line", "label": "The note", "default": "A short note in your dog's voice comes in the box." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "check_line", "label": "The check", "default": "A person checks every design before it prints." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "how_heading", "label": "How it works heading", "default": "How it works" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "step_1", "label": "Step 1", "default": "Add one photo" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "step_2", "label": "Step 2", "default": "See the painting, free" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "step_3", "label": "Step 3", "default": "Order it if you love it" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "also_label", "label": "Other gifts", "default": "Also:" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "dock_line", "label": "Under the price", "default": "Free US shipping" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "cta", "label": "Button", "default": "See my dog painted" }
  ],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "hook",
      "name": "Hook",
      "settings": [
        { "type": "text", "id": "key", "label": "Key", "info": "The value a post puts in ?hook=, for example roast. The first hook is the default." },
        { "type": "text", "id": "headline", "label": "Headline" },
        { "type": "text", "id": "headline_em", "label": "Headline, italic part" },
        { "type": "text", "id": "line", "label": "Line under the headline" }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "presets": [{ "name": "HS social landing" }]
}
{% endschema %}
